SUMMARY:Viruses as Agents of Eukaryotic Genome Evolution
LOCATION:Grande salle des séances - Institut de France - 23 quai de Conti
DESCRIPTION:Type : Conférences\nPublic : Tous publics\nInscription : Inscriptions à venir\nWhile recurring epidemics have highlighted viruses for their potential to cause disease\, this conference will focus on aspects related to their overall impact on the evolution of species.\nLien : https://www.academie-sciences.fr/viruses-agents-eukaryotic-genome-evolution
URL:https://www.academie-sciences.fr/viruses-agents-eukaryotic-genome-evolution
END:VEVENT
